## QUESTION: TTL Kyun Required Hai?
------------------------------------

    TTL event-based invalidation ka safety net hai.

    Maan lo update ke dauran event miss ho gaya — kyunki:

      • Instance down tha
      • Network failure tha
      • Consumer lag tha
      • Admin ne directly DB update kiya (Rules Service bypass → event publish nahi hua)

    TTL ensure karta hai:
     - Local Cache TTL: 60 sec → max 60 sec stale
     - Rules Redis TTL: 5 min → max 5 min stale (agar Rules Service ka Redis write (Update) miss ho gaya)

    TTL expire hone ke baad: next request pe Local MISS → Redis MISS → DB fetch → fresh data populate.

    ⚠️ TTL ke bina: event miss ho to purana rule indefinitely cached rahega — customer ko galat limit enforce hogi. Production me bahut dangerous.



