   a) Request API Gateway instance pe pahunchti hai
   b) Local Cache check: rule:1 → HIT ✅ (event se already populated)
   c) Global rate limit apply: user ka total count 1000 req/min cross hua? → Nahi
   d) Request Payment Service ko forward

   ─── Payment Service Level ───

   e) Request Payment Service instance pe pahunchti hai
   f) Local Cache check: rule:2 → HIT ✅ (event se already populated)
   g) Per-user rate limit apply: user ki 20 req/min cross hui? → Nahi
   h) Request process





